sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Auth as AuthController
  participant Service as AuthService
  participant User as UserRepository
  participant Otp as EmailOtpRepository
  participant Mail as EmailProvider

  Guest->>Web: Submit register form
  Web->>Auth: POST /api/v1/auth/register
  Auth->>Service: register(request)
  Service->>User: Check email uniqueness
  Service->>Service: Hash password and validate confirmation
  Service->>User: Save pending user
  Service->>Otp: Save hashed OTP with TTL
  Service-->>Mail: Send verification email after commit
  Service-->>Auth: Registration pending response
  Auth-->>Web: 201 Created
  Web-->>Guest: Show Vietnamese OTP instruction
